SCCB-PROP-SEC-001
Contact Form Spam Protection Framework

SCCB ID: SCCB-PROP-SEC-001

Module: Website Security

Application: Propertism.in

Priority: High

Risk Level: Low

Implementation Type: Enhancement

Version: 1.0.0

Status: Approved for Development

1. Objective

Replace the existing arithmetic-based captcha with a modern, user-friendly, enterprise-grade spam protection framework that improves the enquiry experience while significantly reducing automated spam submissions.

2. Business Justification

The current arithmetic captcha requires users to solve simple mathematical expressions before submitting an enquiry.

Although functional, this introduces unnecessary friction, particularly for:

NRI customers
International buyers
Senior citizens
Mobile users
Premium clientele

Modern spambots can also solve simple arithmetic expressions with ease, making the existing implementation less effective.

Google reCAPTCHA provides a globally recognized, low-friction verification mechanism with significantly stronger bot detection capabilities.

3. Scope

This SCCB applies to all public-facing enquiry forms including:

Contact Us
Property Enquiry
Schedule Site Visit
Request Callback
Sell Property
Rent Property
Future Lead Capture Forms
4. Functional Changes
4.1 Remove Existing Expression Captcha

Remove:

Arithmetic question generation
Session storage
Expression validation
Frontend expression display
Backend arithmetic verification
4.2 Integrate Google reCAPTCHA v2 Checkbox

Replace with:

☑ I'm not a robot

Features:

Official Google widget
Responsive layout
Mobile compatible
Accessible
Theme compatible
4.3 Server-side Verification

Every submission shall:

Receive Google verification token.
Send token securely to Google Verification API.
Verify authenticity.
Accept only verified requests.

No enquiry shall be processed without successful verification.

4.4 Failure Handling

If verification fails:

Display:

Please complete the security verification before submitting your enquiry.

No enquiry shall be stored.

No email shall be generated.

No lead shall be created.

5. Additional Spam Protection Layers
Layer 1

Google reCAPTCHA v2 Checkbox

Purpose:

Primary human verification.

Layer 2

Hidden Honeypot Field

Purpose:

Trap automated bots that populate hidden inputs.

Human users never interact with this field.

Layer 3

IP Rate Limiting

Recommended limits:

Maximum 5 submissions
Per IP
Within 10 minutes

Excess requests shall receive:

HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests)

Layer 4

Minimum Submission Time

Reject submissions completed unrealistically quickly.

Recommended threshold:

2–3 seconds minimum

Purpose:

Prevent scripted instant submissions.

Layer 5

Server-side Validation

All validation shall remain server-side.

Client-side validation shall never be considered authoritative.

Layer 6

Spam Event Logging

Log:

Timestamp
IP Address
User Agent
Requested Form
Failure Reason

Logs shall support future analysis and tuning.

6. Configuration

Environment variables:

RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=

RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=

No credentials shall be hardcoded.

